  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>z</mi></math> is a complex number satisfying the equation <math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ω</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then the locus of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ω</mi></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "We have,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> (Putting&nbsp;<math><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math> )<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>ω</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> so<br /><math><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> (from equation <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> )<br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> Locus of the point <math><mi>ω</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> will be <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math>"
  }
